n any transfer document , as the appointed attorney will do all\r\nthat .\r\nif you agree to act as the next of kin / beneficiary to enable me\r\ntransfer / convert the money to our own benefit / use . i will give you 30 \% of\r\nusd 32 m , 60 \% will be for me while 10 \% will be to take care of all unforeseen\r\nexpenses as we may incure in the course of concluding this transaction .\r\ni am urgently waiting for your positive reply on the address below .\r\nregards ,\r\nmr . richard mayer\r\nrichardmayer @ walla . com\r\n',spam
